## Interface: 16001
## Title: Mute Bow Sounds
## Notes: Mutes the hunter bow pullback sound, plus any other shot sound you tick.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 1.0.0
## Category: Audio
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Weapon_Bow_05
## SavedVariables: MuteBowSoundsDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: MuteBowSounds_CompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: MuteBowSounds_CompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: MuteBowSounds_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Sounds owns the sound list, the saved settings and the muting, and
# Options builds the settings panel, the slash command and the addon-menu entry on top of it.

Core\Sounds.lua
UI\Options.lua
